\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\ulnone\b0 May generate incorrect code\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Requires testing and review\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Can introduce security issues\par

