\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qc\ul\b\fs28 Chapter 9\par
Image Generative AI\par
\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\ulnone\b0\fs24\lang16393 Image Generation AI is a type of Generative Artificial Intelligence that creates new images from text descriptions, sketches, or existing images. It uses advanced deep learning models to understand patterns, colors, shapes, textures, and objects from large image datasets and then generates entirely new visuals based on user instructions.\par
Image Generation AI has revolutionized the fields of design, marketing, advertising, entertainment, education, and digital art by enabling users to create high-quality images within seconds.\par
\par
\ul\b How Image Generation AI Works\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0 1.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\ulnone\b0 Data Collection\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj Millions of images are collected and used for training.\par
{\listtext\f0 1\tab}The images contain various objects, scenes, colors, and styles.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0 2.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj Model Training\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj AI learns patterns, relationships, and visual features from the training data.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0 3.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj Understanding the Prompt\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj Users provide a text prompt describing the desired image.\par

